  Deliberately empty.

  app_name, title_activity_main, package_name and custom_url_scheme used to be
  hardcoded here. They are now generated from client/brand.properties by
  `resValue` in app/build.gradle, so that the home-screen name and the package id
  have exactly ONE definition instead of one here, one in build.gradle, one in
  Info.plist and one in the Xcode project.

  Do not add them back: AAPT rejects a resource that is declared both here and by
  resValue ("duplicate value for resource"), and the build fails outright.

  The file itself stays because the Capacitor Android template expects it and
  `cap sync` reports on it; any string that is genuinely the SAME for every
  institution belongs here.
